00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:06.520
I-If I don't get outta here,
what's gonna happen to me?

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.230
Wouldn't want our merchandise
getting damaged.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.020
Capture

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.150
Processing

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.230
Production

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.320
Shipment

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.620
I-I've gotta get out of here!

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:26.920
If I can't escape, then at least
<i>you </i>can live free, Pip!

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.550
You're small enough
to slip through the bars!

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:34.470
C'mon, listen to your papa!

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:41.310
I know, Pip, but I... I can't...

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.100
I can't give up like this!

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.860
I think I broke a tooth...

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:51.900
Papa!

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.530
Pipe down, will ya?

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.160
Why're ya making such a ruckus?

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:02.620
I-I'm sorry! Please don't turn me into
weapons and sell me! At least spare Pip!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.500
The hell are you talking about?

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.710
Oh, boy, we got ourselves
another big goofball, huh?

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:14.760
What's up, little guy? You hungry?

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:20.720
Please, get us out of here!
I'm on an important journey!

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.970
I got separated from
my other party member,

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.140
and I don't want my story to end
with getting turned into cool gear!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:29.100
Sounds like you got problems, all right.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:32.190
But if you wanna leave so bad, then leave.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.780
It was unlocked this whole time?!

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:35.990
Come on over and have
a cup of tea with us first, a'ight?

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:39.240
I'll introduce ya to the others.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.120
Th-The others?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:44.500
They've got that many other prisoners?!

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.750
I wonder who the head honcho is in here!

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.540
A'ight, punks, lemme tell ya
how it works around here!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.460
Yessir!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.710
Hey, guys! We got a newcomer.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.960
I'm done for!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:59.220
Pleased to meetcha!

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.390
What kind of prison is this?!

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.430
This little dog guy is Daniel.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.100
I'm not a werewolf.

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.640
And here're the
Three Skeleton Bros.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:08.940
Wuzzup!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:14.860
And this devastating beauty here
is our very own Madonna:

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:17.070
The lovely Cassandra!

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:19.950
Aww, you guys always make such a fuss.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.740
But if you'd like a headshot, here you go.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.830
Oh, uh, thanks.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:25.330
And I'm Steve. Pleased to have ya here!

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.910
And this is everyone else.
Too many to name.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.330
--Introduce us, dammit!
--You had <i>one job</i>!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.540
Get over here and introduce yourselves.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.000
O-Okay.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.050
Are you all here because
you were captured?

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:39.220
Yup.

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:41.140
Have you ever tried to escape?

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.640
Nah.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:47.930
This dungeon's part of a fighting arena
owned by some human Margrave. Look.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:52.230
It's pretty chill. No pushy
salespeople or hunters dropping by.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:52.180
"Baldy" "I looove tiddies!"
"what a narcissist lmao"

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:55.270
Every now and then,
we get Heroes barging in.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.730
I smell loot!

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.150
But the jailers take care of 'em for us.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:02.200
Honestly, it's easier
in here than out there.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.080
And the jailers let us do what we want,
so we can hang out all we want.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:06.450
The food's pretty good, too.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.290
B-But this is still a prison!

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:11.120
You might be treated okay now,

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.290
but eventually, something bad's
gonna happen to you guys!

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:20.050
You're just sayin' that 'cause you
haven't seen the rest of the place yet.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:26.100
No need to worry 'bout hygiene! We got
a huge bath, complete with jacuzzi jets!

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.060
Wha...?!

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:30.980
And don't worry 'bout getting out
of shape! We got all the latest machines!

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:31.940
Whoa!

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:35.150
And we got entertainment, too:
like this state-of-the-art theater!

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:37.480
That's so cool!

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:41.900
Wait, wait, I bet that's just
to make sure we don't try to escape!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.110
Look at our rooms!
They're just jail cells!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.240
Well, actually...

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.360
Cassandra's Room

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:51.580
If you wanna change up your room,
you totally can! Here's Cass'.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.210
That's a full-blown renovation!

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:59.760
We've been calling her room The Queen's
Chamber. Bow when you walk by, yeah?

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.220
Yeah, that makes sense.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.010
Don't wanna get hit with an ancient curse.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.140
That's it for the dungeon tour.

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:09.430
Think of how you want
to change up your room, yeah?

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.180
Th-Thanks, but I...

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:13.810
The jailers can getcha
whatever mats you need.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.940
They can?!

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.900
See, check it out.

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.770
Most of the time,
they just play cards with us.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:19.900
Hey, welcome back!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.820
They were here the whole time?!

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:25.070
Sounds like it's time for work.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:29.830
First round's the skeletons
versus the dragon.

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.790
Get ready, mmkay?

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.040
You got it, fam!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.130
What was he talking about?

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.750
I told ya this was an arena, right?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.090
Yeah?

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:45.630
Ladies and gentlemen!
Are you ready to rumble?!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.640
Another day, another horde of monsters...

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.810
...fighting to the death
for <i>your </i>entertainment!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:59.060
Our first champions are our undead
champions! Pain means nothin' to 'em!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:03.190
They've worked as a deadly team to
bring countless monsters to their doom!

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.530
Give it up for the Skeleton Brothers!

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.320
Rock on, dudes!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:11.740
And in the opposite corner...

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:18.580
The most powerful,
most horrific of all evil creatures...

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:24.010
The Red Dragon!

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:28.970
Are the Skeleton Brothers any match
for his horrible fire breath?!

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:31.470
Don't worry, I can't
actually breathe fire!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.220
Let the battle begin!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.980
Um, uh...

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.520
You ready to die, dragon?!

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.610
Here comes the pain!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:43.400
Get back here!

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.530
Get back here!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.170
Would you look at that!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:09.090
My God! The dragon's terrible tail strike
smashed the skeletons to bits!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.140
I'ts over before it even begun, folks!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.890
A-Are you guys okay?!

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.390
Hell yeah, dude!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.230
We can come apart whenever we want!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:26.610
Just gotta put ourselves
back together, and bam, we good!

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:30.200
W-Well, I'm glad everything went okay.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.320
Yeah, all according to script!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.490
Does this happen every day?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.830
Nah, once every three days.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:41.040
We base our shows on the betting odds
to make sure the house makes a profit.

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.040
You gotta lose today, okay?

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.250
Roger that.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.090
The Margrave makes a killing
off our performances.

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:49.010
And when he's happy, we get
treated well, so we're happy, too.

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:51.430
Th-That makes sense.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:55.100
The human world can be
hella annoying at times,

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:59.810
but you can find a way
to coexist with 'em in it.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:03.110
We can coexist...

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:07.190
Sorry to keep you waiting, Pip!
I'm all done with work for the day!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.280
Pip's not here!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.650
Urgent Quest

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.650
Find Pip!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:17.160
Pip! Piiip! Where are you?!

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.620
Pip! Pip!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.960
Pip?

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:21.670
Pip!

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:23.710
He's gone...

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.460
Where did he go?!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.500
What's up?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.260
U-Uh...

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.250
Cassandra's Ice Cream:
Touch and 
you're dead!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.250
Nice               and               Cold

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.260
Pip!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.890
I saw him in the drainage ditch,

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:38.060
so I fished him out and
put him in the ice room.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:40.060
Little guy likes to be cold.

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:43.440
Thank you so much! You saved his life!

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.980
Just doin' my job.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:50.320
I ordered it some snow to eat, too.
Keep an eye on him, mmkay?

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.820
W-Will do!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.410
We can coexist!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.660
I never knew you could
live a life like this...

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.670
I wonder what Dearia's up to right now?

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:06.960
He must be looking everywhere for me...

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.960
Here's what Dearia <i>was </i>up to.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.550
Can't... go on.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.220
That makes 12 now!

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.680
Not bad, Elf. But I'm up next.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:25.400
Loser foots the bill.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.360
You still good with those rules?

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:29.980
Absolutely.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:34.860
Thirteen contenders, defeated!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.030
Not looking for Letty in the slightest.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.920
It's now been ten days
since Letty arrived at the arena.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.170
Man, they worked us to the bone.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.880
Good work!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.890
Great job today. The crowd's
gotten bigger since you started.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:02.930
Where the heck is Dearia?!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:04.640
Why're you freakin' out?

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.900
Papa!

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.690
Good work out there. This little guy
was so good waiting for you.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.820
Th-Thank you for helping.

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.650
My pleasure.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:19.700
I totally thought Dearia would
find me in two or three days.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:24.580
Guess magic's not as all-powerful
as I thought, or that easy to cast.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.170
We're in trouble!

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:30.790
Everyone, gather round!
News from the Margrave!

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.840
The Margrave is <i>dead</i>?

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.210
What?!

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:36.930
So what?

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:37.930
Huh?

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:41.680
Humans up and die all the time.
Why's this time special?

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.640
Doesn't that just mean
the arena gets a new owner?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.230
I wish that were the case.

00:11:48.230 --> 00:11:50.400
But his oldest son inherited it,

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:54.320
and he wants to shut down the arena
for its "barbaric treatment of monsters."

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.150
He also...

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:59.700
...wants all of you euthanized.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:04.160
H-He's gonna kill everyone?! But why?!

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.660
Is it my fault?

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:10.290
Did he find out about me pilfering
some profits to build a rotating theatre?

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.210
Huh?

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.670
Or was it because we fudged the numbers
in our favor so we could buy stuff?

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:15.840
Huh? Wha...?

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:20.720
Or was it because we used that money
to go on vacation? That sure was fun.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.510
You have that many reasons?!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:28.020
No, they just don't want you to take
revenge on us for capturing you.

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:30.440
Don't worry, they didn't find out!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.270
The guards were in on it, too?!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:37.400
Meh, they enslaved us, we scammed
them, so we can call it even.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:38.610
I guess...

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.570
That's not our biggest
problem right now, though.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:47.580
We just learned all this from
the new Margrave's mercs.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.620
Once they've finished evacuating
the human employees,

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.830
they're gonna head in and start killing.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.880
They're already here?!

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.260
H-How're we gonna get outta this?!

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:57.970
Man, not even two weeks' notice?

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.800
Okay, gang, we're gettin' outta here!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.140
Mmkay.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:06.600
But the mercs are right outside
the gates! How're we getting out?

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:08.350
We're gonna go through the aquaduct.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.980
There's a big ancient aqueduct
that runs underneath this whole place.

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:14.440
It connects up to an old decrepit
well outside the walls.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:17.570
The whole thing's too old
to be on any maps, too.

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:20.530
But just to make sure none of them
find out we're going that way,

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.910
we're gonna have to distract
the hell outta those humans.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:25.530
So let's get us a team to do just that.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.700
Distraction Team

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.330
Why am I on this team?!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.460
You'll stick out otherwise.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.920
Look at you. You're a dragon.

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:35.880
No way, no how! I'll just get in your way!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:38.590
We'll be fine, even without a script.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:42.720
How are we gonna be fine?! Now it's
<i>really </i>gonna be a fight to the death!

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:45.350
Don't freak out, man!

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:47.260
Trust your friends, yeah?

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.900
My friends...

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:59.070
You've got a little one
to protect, too, right?

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.580
Okay, I'm in.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.160
Let's do this!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.920
Who put out the lights?

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.630
Can't see shit in here.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:19.840
Not like we need to see
that well to kill 'em all.

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:25.300
And they're all in cages!
This is gonna be a piece of cake.

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.180
I'll make it quick for yo--

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:27.420
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:27.470
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:27.510
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:27.550
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:27.590
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:27.630
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:27.670
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:27.720
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:27.800
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:27.840
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.180
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:28.380
