00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:29.010
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:29.050
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:29.090
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:29.180
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:29.340
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:29.390
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:29.550
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:29.590
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:29.640
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:29.680
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:29.840
{=2}HI-STUPID

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:31.100
Wha...?!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.100
I'll slaughter them!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.310
They're all gone!

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.600
Find them!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.980
The decoy worked!

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:39.320
It just made them angrier, though.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:42.490
Are you sure you should have
brought your little one with you?

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:47.320
Well, I tried to send him with
the others, but he didn't listen.

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:52.250
No more time for idle chat.
Let's get the ball rolling.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.250
On it.

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.040
Oranges

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.630
What the heck?! What happened
to not standing out?!

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:02.840
You'll be fine.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:06.090
We've got dungeon brick wallpaper
on one side, so you'll blend in.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.050
Why only one one side?

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.760
You gotta sneak around in cardboard
boxes for stealth missions, right?

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:13.890
Plasterin' every side with
that would ruin the aesthetic!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.600
Oh.

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:18.110
Listen up, I'mma tell you
how the box plan works.

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:19.650
First, you get some porn.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.060
"Mommy Milker SPECIAL ISSUE:
Barmaids Galore"

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:20.730
What?

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:24.990
Set it out as bait, then hide
and wait for them to take it.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:27.610
Once they do,

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:28.910
knock 'em out!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.790
Is it really that easy?

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:33.790
Oh, yeah, totally.

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:36.670
Let's use it on those guys over there.

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.920
Okay.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.880
They must be hiding somewhere.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:45.010
First I have to sneak up on them,

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.220
then I set the book down...

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:48.300
Huh?

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:51.260
How am I supposed to put the book down?

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.020
Did I get things out of order?!

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.850
I can't even see where I'm going!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:04.280
The walls are closin' in on us!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:05.650
Huh? What?! What's going on?!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.070
Don't leave me behind!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:08.910
Dammit!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:10.700
O-Oh, no! A dead end!

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:11.910
Why won't it open?!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:14.910
Nobody told us there were traps down here!

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.960
What the heck is going on?

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:22.880
A-Are you okay?!

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.510
Are they even alive?

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:25.840
What was that noise?!

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.180
Oh, no, they're coming!

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.680
Found one!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.350
O-Oh, no!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.430
No, don't do that in here, or--

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:42.110
The devastating cry of a beast!

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:52.120
Go home, lads.

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:54.450
R-Retreat!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.540
You haven't seen the last of us!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.540
I <i>knew </i>it'd echo real bad in here.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.750
Did that shriek come
outta your little one?

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.300
We won't be able to sneak
around anymore after that.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.760
I'm so sorry.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:10.220
Wait, where's Cassandra?

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:13.100
Oh, she's over there.

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.890
And now for my final riddle!

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:19.270
The beer meant for your unit was
stolen and sold by someone else!

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:22.100
Tell me, who took the booze?

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:25.900
Here's a hint: it's someone who
just got some fancy new gear.

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.150
I knew it was you!

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.700
We were gonna drink
that together, asshole!

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:39.120
She's using riddles to trick them
into fighting each other.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:42.250
She's so scary! Don't look, Pip!

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.330
A'ight, let's go.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.710
O-Okay.

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.550
Found them! This way!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:51.510
Halt!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.140
Here they come.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.220
Hind leg kick!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.770
Enjoy your stay!

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.570
The hell is this place?

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:08.730
It gives me the creeps...

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.570
D-Dude!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.160
The hell'd they go?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.290
That way!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.130
No, this way!

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:28.250
E-Everyone's probably
escaped by now, right?

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.760
We've bought them plenty of time.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:32.590
Now's the time for us to make our escape.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:36.510
This way.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.770
Playtime's over, fiends!

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.060
We're surrounded!

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.440
You sure had your fun with us...

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.110
But now there's nowhere for you to run!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.530
We're gonna drag all you
beasts outta hiding...

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:00.240
...and turn you into mats
for some shiny new--

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:04.710
Huh?!

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:08.090
Dearia!

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:11.260
I'm glad to see you're doing well, Letty.

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:14.840
Why are you here? Wait, were you
looking for me this whole time?!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.300
Absolutely not.

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:21.850
I heard you were here at this arena,

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:26.060
but letting you handle your own problems
would help you build character,

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.770
so I decided to let you be
and watch from afar.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.480
The reason I'm here is for
another matter entirely.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.440
Another training arc?!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.570
Who's this? Buddy of yours?

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.860
What a hottie!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.450
My name is Dearia. Thank you for
the help you've given Letty here.

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:40.950
It was no biggie.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:45.620
I heard some men had been hired
to slaughter non-humans,

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:48.040
so I came to assist you.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.790
Though I see that was not necessary.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.630
Let's get out of here, Dearia!

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.510
Agreed. Before that, though,

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:59.850
let me erase the memories of these
guards so they don't follow us.

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.560
Magic sure makes things easy.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:06.940
Hey! Hey, dudes! Over here!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:11.610
I'm so glad you guys are okay!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:14.030
We're still missing some.

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:16.280
Sorry, took us a minute!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.530
The guards!

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:22.660
Sheesh, how long does it take
to deliver letters of resignation?

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.200
Not long.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:29.330
It took a while to liberate everything
from our storerooms, though.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.840
You guys rule!

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.130
What will you do now?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.680
Eh, we'll figure it out.

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.260
Whaddya guys think about
becoming a traveling circus?

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:44.010
Sounds great!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:45.930
They sure are close with one another.

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:48.600
You can say that again!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:52.360
You could stay with them if you like.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.900
No, thanks.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:58.110
Who knows what I'd have to do in a circus.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.200
My, are you sure?

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:03.200
Still, I learned a lot from them.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:06.870
Who, what, or where they
are doesn't matter at all,

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:11.250
because wherever they end up
is "home" to them.

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:12.880
Papa!

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:19.630
So now I know I can find a place
like that for me and my family, too.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.600
I see.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:26.680
Thanks for everything!

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:36.650
So Dearia, what were you doing
for these last ten days?

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:38.360
Nothing in particular.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:40.070
While I was on my way here...

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:42.490
Y-You!

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:45.530
I went around to all the local lords

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:49.000
and told them of the new
Margrave's many crimes.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:53.630
Dealing with that arena will likely
be the last thing on his mind now.

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:55.420
Keep that a secret, all right?

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:57.460
Wow!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:22:01.180
You sure have a lot of
human friends, huh, Dearia?

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:03.300
Only due to my work, of course.

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:07.390
That's the Dark Lord of
Real Estate for ya! What a guy!

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:37.560
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:37.600
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:37.640
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:40.860
Do you know the difference
between a veranda and a balcony?

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:40.940
Veranda vs. Balcony

00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:44.490
A veranda is roofed,
while a balcony is not.

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:44.560
Veranda

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:44.560
Balcony

00:23:44.490 --> 00:23:47.110
Next time, "Pip Goes on an Adventure."

00:23:47.360 --> 00:23:47.400
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:47.440
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:48.400
Elf Housing Realty
